            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Fixes

- Renaming a group now works. Before, the dialog opened empty and clicking Rename did nothing. Creating a group by clicking Create is fixed the same way.
- After you add a site, the sidebar scrolls to it.
- The bottom of the sidebar no longer sits on top of the site list.

Still made for **Patchy 1.2.1**.
]]></description>
